    {
      "question_number": 1,
      "stem_markdown": "A curve has equation $y=5+3x-2x^2$ and a straight line has equation $y=kx+13$, where $k$ is a constant.\n\nFind the set of values of $k$ for which the curve and the line do not meet.",
      "total_marks": 4,
      "source_page_numbers": [
        2
      ],
      "parts": [],
      "mark_scheme_items": [
        {
          "sequence_number": 1,
          "mark_code": "B1",
          "content_markdown": "$$[kx+13=5+3x-2x^2\\Rightarrow]\\ 2x^2+(k-3)x+8\\ [=0]$$",
          "guidance_markdown": "OE\n\nEliminate $y$ to obtain a three-term quadratic.",
          "is_final_answer": false,
          "is_alternative_method": false,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            9
          ]
        },
        {
          "sequence_number": 2,
          "mark_code": "M1",
          "content_markdown": "Use of $b^2-4ac<0$ or $b^2-4ac=0$ with their coefficients of their new quadratic equation. Condone $\\pm$ errors only.",
          "guidance_markdown": "OE\n\nUse of ‘$>0$’ scores M0, unless recovered.",
          "is_final_answer": false,
          "is_alternative_method": false,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            9
          ]
        },
        {
          "sequence_number": 3,
          "mark_code": "A1",
          "content_markdown": "$-5$ and $11$",
          "guidance_markdown": "Identification of correct critical values, may only be seen in their final answer.",
          "is_final_answer": false,
          "is_alternative_method": false,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            9
          ]
        },
        {
          "sequence_number": 4,
          "mark_code": "A1",
          "content_markdown": "$$-5<k<11$$",
          "guidance_markdown": "CWO\n\nDo not allow ‘or’.\n\nA0 if $\\leqslant$ sign or signs used.",
          "is_final_answer": true,
          "is_alternative_method": false,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            9
          ]
        }
      ],
      "assets": [],
      "metadata": null
    },
    {
      "question_number": 2,
      "stem_markdown": "The diagram shows the curve with equation $y=2x^2-\\dfrac{5}{x}+3$. The curve crosses the $x$-axis at the point $P(1,0)$ and $M$ is a minimum point.",
