          "mark_code": "M1",
          "content_markdown": "$$\\text{Their }\\left(4x+\\frac{5}{x^2}\\right)=0$$\nand valid method as far as ‘$x=\\ldots$’",
          "guidance_markdown": "Equate their derivative of the form\n\n$$Ax\\pm\\frac{B}{x^2}$$\n\nto zero, where $A,B\\ne0$, and solve. If no working is seen, this can be implied by a correct answer for $x$.",
