      "question_number": 4,
      "stem_markdown": "The diagram shows a triangle $OAB$ where $OA=OB=10\\text{ cm}$ and $\\angle AOB=0.8$ radians.\n\nPoints $C$ and $D$ on $OA$ and $OB$ respectively are such that the arc $CD$ is part of a circle with centre $O$ and radius $6\\text{ cm}$. The shaded region is bounded by the arc $CD$ and the line segments $CA$, $AB$ and $BD$.",
