          "guidance_markdown": "Allow angles correctly converted to degrees for this mark.\n\n$0.8\\text{ rad}=45.8^\\circ$, $\\angle OAB=\\angle OBA=67.1^\\circ$.\n\n$\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi-0.8}{2}\\right)=1.17$\n\nThis mark can be implied by AWRT 7.8.",
