    {
      "question_number": 6,
      "stem_markdown": "The diagram shows a circle $C$ of radius $r$, where $x>0$ and $y>0$ for all points on $C$. The least distance between any point on $C$ and the $x$-axis is $8$ units, and the least distance between any point on $C$ and the $y$-axis is $5$ units.",
      "total_marks": 6,
      "source_page_numbers": [
        7
      ],
      "parts": [
        {
          "label_path": [
            "a"
          ],
          "prompt_markdown": "State the coordinates of the centre of the circle in terms of $r$.",
          "marks": 1,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            7
          ]
        },
        {
          "label_path": [
            "b"
          ],
          "prompt_markdown": "Given that the distance between the origin and the centre of the circle is $15$ units, find the value of $r$.",
          "marks": 3,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            7
          ]
        },
        {
          "label_path": [
            "c"
          ],
          "prompt_markdown": "The point on the circle furthest from the origin is denoted by $P$.\n\nFind the gradient of the tangent to the circle at $P$.",
          "marks": 2,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            7
          ]
        }
      ],
      "mark_scheme_items": [
        {
          "sequence_number": 1,
          "mark_code": "B1",
          "content_markdown": "$$(r+5,r+8)$$",
          "guidance_markdown": "OE\n\nAllow $x=r+5$, $y=r+8$.\n\nIf values are stated without reference to $x$ and $y$, take the first value to be their $x$.",
          "is_final_answer": true,
          "is_alternative_method": false,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            13
          ]
        },
        {
          "sequence_number": 2,
          "mark_code": "B1 FT",
          "content_markdown": "$$\\text{their }(r+5)^2+\\text{their }(r+8)^2=15^2$$",
          "guidance_markdown": "OE\n\nFollowing their answers to **(a)**, which must both contain $r$.",
          "is_final_answer": false,
          "is_alternative_method": false,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            13
          ]
        },
        {
          "sequence_number": 3,
          "mark_code": "M1",
          "content_markdown": "$$[r^2+13r-68[=0]\\Rightarrow](r+17)(r-4)[=0]$$",
          "guidance_markdown": "Or other valid method of solution for their three-term quadratic.",
          "is_final_answer": false,
          "is_alternative_method": false,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            13
          ]
        },
        {
          "sequence_number": 4,
          "mark_code": "A1",
          "content_markdown": "$$[r=]4$$",
          "guidance_markdown": "CWO\n\n$r=-4\\Rightarrow r=4$ scores A0.",
          "is_final_answer": true,
          "is_alternative_method": false,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            13
          ]
        },
        {
          "sequence_number": 5,
          "mark_code": null,
          "content_markdown": "",
          "guidance_markdown": "**Special Case:** After B1M0, $r=4$ scores **SCB1**, but after B1M0, $r=-4\\Rightarrow r=4$ scores B0.",
          "is_final_answer": false,
          "is_alternative_method": false,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            13
          ]
        },
        {
          "sequence_number": 6,
          "mark_code": "M1",
          "content_markdown": "$$\\frac{\\text{their }(r+8)}{\\text{their }(r+5)}$$\n\nfrom **(a)** with their $r$ from **(b)**, or\n\n$$\\frac{(\\text{their }r\\text{ from (b)})+8}{(\\text{their }r\\text{ from (b)})+5}$$",
          "guidance_markdown": "$r>0$ only.",
          "is_final_answer": false,
          "is_alternative_method": false,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            13
          ]
        },
        {
          "sequence_number": 7,
          "mark_code": "A1 FT",
          "content_markdown": "$$-\\frac34$$",
          "guidance_markdown": "OE, i.e.\n\n$$-\\frac{\\text{their }(r+5)}{\\text{their }(r+8)}$$\n\nor\n\n$$-\\frac{(\\text{their }r\\text{ from (b)})+8}{(\\text{their }r\\text{ from (b)})+5}.$$",
          "is_final_answer": true,
          "is_alternative_method": false,
          "source_page_numbers": [
            13
